baba ka apne dhoond rahi sar yahi'n kahi'n<br>
<br>
chilla rahi hai aye mere shero jawab do <br>
aur dhoondti hai aun o mohd ke lasho'n ko <br>
zakhmi pade hai'n dono baradar yahi'n kahi'n<br>
<br>
qasim ki khushbu aati hai roti hai mehlaqa <br>
awaaz de rahi hai yahiran me baarha <br>
tukde huwa hai qasim e be-par yahi'n kahi'n<br>
<br>
girti hai aur uth-ti hai lasho'n ke darmiya'n <br>
aur keh rahi hai'n aasnu bahakar sakina jaa'n <br>
besar pada hai lashkar-e-sarwar yahi'n kahi'n<br>
<br>
kaano'n se khoo'n tapakta hai kurta lahu me tar <br>
pyaaso'n ka nouha jaari hai sukhi zubaan par <br>
kehti hai roke hai mera asgher yahi'n kahi'n<br>
<br>
abbas e bawafa ki usey yaad aayegi <br>
ammu kaha'n ho kehte huwe dhoondne lagi <br>
sheh kapada tha sheh ka baradar yahi'n kahi'n<br>
<br>
yeh kehke dhoodne lagi wo lasha-e-pidar <br>
